1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:10,163
At bedtime, when a senior places their iPhone horizontally on a nightstand charger, PNCC Care automatically transitions into StandBy Ambient Mode.

2
00:00:10,163 --> 00:00:16,383
The screen turns into an oversized digital clock displaying the current time and safe status.

3
00:00:16,383 --> 00:00:23,271
In a dark room, the display shifts to a warm red hue that won't disrupt sleep or strain sensitive eyes.

4
00:00:23,271 --> 00:00:28,822
If the senior wakes up in the middle of the night, the time is visible at a glance.

5
00:00:28,822 --> 00:00:33,704
It's a reliable safety guard by day and a calming bedside clock by night.
